WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Welcome to DealingTree.com!

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Use the menu near the beginning of the page
to navigate the site.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.500
To begin, select <b>Join</b>.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.500
Answer all of the prompts
completely and accurately

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Then click <b>Sign up!</b>

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Then, to start saving, check
out the deals on the home page

7
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.000
For fastest access to relevant deals

8
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.500
allow the site to determine
your location if prompted.

9
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
You can also choose a location
using the drop-down selection.

10
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.000
Click a title for details about a deal

11
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.500
including the provider, location,
description, and even reviews.

12
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.500
Back on the home screen, you can
instantly purchase a deal by dragging
it to the <b>Your Deals</b> area.

13
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:48.500
If your browser does not
support drag-and-drop

14
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.500
simply click a <b>Buy</b> button
to purchase a deal instantly.

15
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Thank you for saving with us!

